  "solution": {
    "text": "Ionization Enthalpy&nbsp;values indicate&nbsp;that the metal belongs to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi>st</mi></msup></math> group, since the second ionization enthalpy&nbsp;is very high.<br />(Q - only one valence electron)<br />Metal hydroxide will be of the type, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MOH</mi></math>.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <munder> <mrow> <mtext>MOH</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>mol</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </munder> <mo>+</mo><munder> <mrow> <mtext>HCl</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>mol</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </munder> <mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>MCl</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>MOH</mtext><mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>SO</mtext></mrow> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <mo>&#8594;</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>SO</mtext></mrow> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <mo>+</mo><msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>mol</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mtext>mol</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> So, one mole of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>&nbsp;is required to react with one mole of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MOH</mi></math>.<br /><br />So, <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> mole of <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>SO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>4</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is required to react with one mole of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MOH</mi></math>.",
